He stopped the car in a parking lot and Mark was left alone as his two companions got out to urinate. Realizing something wasn't right, Mark scrambled out of the truck and took off in the direction of the border, even though the levee made it impossible to cross. As he ran, David, Serna, Valdez and Sergio Martinez-Selinas arrived, following behind in the blue Chevrolet suburban. They chased Mark down and ordered him to freeze, telling him he was under arrest for public intoxication. Mark stopped and was bound and blindfolded with duct tape, then forced into the back of the Chevy. By the time the group returned to the ranch, it was almost 3am. Seraphine gave Mark some crackers and water, reassuring him that nothing was going to happen. He then phoned his godmother, Sara Aldrete, telling her,
他把车停在一个停车场里，马克独自留在车里，因为他的两个同伴下车去小便了。马克意识到情况不对，从卡车里挣扎着爬出来，朝着边境方向逃跑，尽管堤坝使得越境成为不可能。当他逃跑时，大卫、塞尔纳、巴尔德斯和塞尔吉奥·马丁内斯-塞利纳斯乘坐一辆蓝色雪佛兰萨博班紧随其后赶到。他们追上马克，命令他站住，告诉他因醉酒闹事而被捕。马克停了下来，被胶带捆住双眼并蒙上眼睛，随后被强行塞进雪佛兰的后座。当这伙人回到牧场时，已经快凌晨3点了。塞拉芬给了马克一些饼干和水，安慰他说什么都不会发生。然后他打电话给他的教母萨拉·阿尔德雷特，告诉她：

