We've done what he asked for. Early the next morning, Mark was removed from the truck and placed in a hammock between two trees. By midday, eight more cult members had arrived to participate in the sacrificial ceremony, including Constanzo, Elio and Aldrete. Constanzo believed women were bad luck for worship, and as the other men would be naked during the ritual, Aldrete was required to stay outside. Mark was taken into the wooden shack where he was forced to kneel before Constanzo and endure extreme acts of torture and sexual assault. Seraphine claimed he was outside when he heard a heavy thudding sound akin to the slicing of a coconut. He was then ordered to go inside the shack and, quote, take him out. Upon entering, he saw Mark Kilroy's naked body alongside a bloody machete, his head cracked open.
“我们已经完成了他要求的事。”第二天一早，马克被从卡车上抬下来，放在两棵树之间的吊床里。到了中午，又有八名邪教成员抵达以参加献祭仪式，其中包括孔斯坦佐、埃利奥和阿尔德雷特。孔斯坦佐认为女性对崇拜不利，而且由于其他男性在仪式期间将赤身裸体，阿尔德雷特被要求留在外面。马克被带进木屋，被迫在孔斯坦佐面前跪下，并遭受极端的酷刑和性侵犯。塞拉芬声称他在外面时听到了一声沉闷的撞击声，类似于切开椰子的声音。随后他被命令进入木屋，并被“带他出来”。进去后，他看到马克·基尔罗伊赤裸的尸体旁放着一把血迹斑斑的砍刀，他的头部裂开。

